### SEC EDGAR Filing Explorer — request collection

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Apple's filings
GET {{host}}/companies/AAPL/filings

### 2. Unknown ticker → 404 TICKER_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/companies/ZZZZ/filings

### 3. Lowercase ticker still resolves
GET {{host}}/companies/aapl/filings

### 4. Spotify's filings
GET {{host}}/companies/SPOT/filings

### 5. JPMorgan's filings
GET {{host}}/companies/JPM/filings

### 6. Filter to 10-K, 5 per page
GET {{host}}/companies/AAPL/filings?formType=10-K&pageSize=5

### 7. Oldest first
GET {{host}}/companies/AAPL/filings?sort=asc&pageSize=3

### 8. Page 2
GET {{host}}/companies/AAPL/filings?page=2&pageSize=5

### 9. Bad page → 400
GET {{host}}/companies/AAPL/filings?page=0

### 10. Bad sort → 400
GET {{host}}/companies/AAPL/filings?sort=sideways